## Execution
Runs: batch

Submit `scripts/submit.sh` through `python3 <workspace>/_system/executorlib.py submit --workspace <project> <script>` using the project's configured executor. Source `<workspace>/_system/gars-env.sh` and invoke `$GARS_PY` for the analysis. Request 1 CPU, 4 GB memory and 15 minutes; expected runtime is under 5 minutes and output size under 10 MB for six samples. Direct logs into this analysis directory. Resolve inputs and run all numerical processing only after approval. On success use `stage03_analysis.py verify` to register the declared outputs and record completion through the prescribed history entry; on failure report the actual error and stop.
